checks/audits/kennedy-center--2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition-2026-09-19-r1-redteam.log-18787-src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:55:      <p class="railed rail-note" data-layer="fact">The federal docket's September 17 minute order was not available as a court-hosted document in the public sources we could preserve. The operative sentence below is reproduced by UPI and by Beatty's counsel; the surrounding motions, declarations, earlier opinions and board records are preserved separately.<Cite s="upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17" passage="To avoid any confusion on that score given more recent events" /><Cite s="beatty-counsel-reaction-2026-09-17" passage="any changes to the scope of the project plans" /></p>
