 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="flex-none size-4 -scale-x-100 text-primary lg:size-6 [&amp;_path]:fill-current"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3.1 3.1V11h1.8V6.314l5.392 5.393 1.415-1.414L6.313 4.9H11V3.1zm17.8 17.8V13h-1.8v4.686l-5.393-5.393-1.415 1.414 5.393 5.393H13v1.8z"></path></svg></span></button><dialog aria-label="Modal Dialog" aria-modal="true" class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 top-0 z-4 size-full max-h-none max-w-none bg-primary hidden"></dialog></div><figcaption class="relative text-sm mt-1 pr-2.5"><div style="max-height:none;overflow:visible"><span class="[&amp;_p]:inline">Texas Attorney General Ken Paxton speaks to supporters after winning the Republican runoff election for U.S. Senate in Texas, defeating incumbent U.S. Senator John Cornyn, in Plano, Texas, U.S., May 26, 2026. REUTERS/Evan Garcia</span></div></figcaption></figure></div><div class="max-w-screen-sm mx-auto"><div data-article-body="true" data-body-type="bodyblocks"><p class="mb-4 text-lg md:leading-8 break-words">By Erin Banco</p><p class="mb-4 text-lg md:leading-8 break-words">NEW YORK, Sept 5 (Reuters) - President Donald Trump&#x27;s MAGA Inc ‌super PAC will spend at ‌least $10 million on the campaign of Texas Attorney ​General Ken Paxton for his U.S. Senate race against Democratic state Representative James Talarico, according to a Federal Election Commission filing on Saturday.</p><p class="mb-4 text-lg md:leading-8 break-words">• ‌The filing indicates ⁠that MAGA Inc&#x27;s spending will include $5 million to run negative ⁠ads against Talarico and $5 million to run positive ads for Paxton, a Republican.</p><div class="max-md:faux-bleed mb-4 bg-accent/2 pb-5 md:invisible md:mb-0 md:h-0 md:overflow-hidden md:pb-0"><div class="py-2 text-center text-xs uppercase">Advertisement</div><div class="flex w-full flex-nowrap justify-center"><div class="flex ad-container" id="_R_kea6m6l1dinpfiuqq5bH1_"><div class="hidden" id="_R_kea6m6l1dinpfiuqq5b_"></div><div class="flex size-full items-center justify-center text-center leading-3 bg-accent/2" style="height:250px;width:300px">Advertisement</div><style type="text/css">#_R_kea6m6l1dinpfiuqq5bH1_ { display: none; }
