data/sources/coverage/thehill-scotus-missouri-house-map.html:1648:<p>It lurches the Supreme Court into the redistricting wars once again.&nbsp;Last December, the high court <a href="https://thehill.com/regulation/court-battles/5634611-texas-redistricting-war-supreme-court/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">revived a congressional map in Texas</a> that sparked the mid-decade redistricting war by adding up to five Republican pickup opportunities. A lower court had invalidated it as a likely racial gerrymander.&nbsp;</p>
