data/sources/coverage/thehill-scotus-missouri-house-map.html-1656-
data/sources/coverage/thehill-scotus-missouri-house-map.html:1657:<p>In May, the court <a href="https://thehill.com/regulation/court-battles/5880850-supreme-court-rejects-virginia-congressional-map/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">refused Virginia Democrats&rsquo; plea</a> to reinstate their congressional map after the state&rsquo;s top court ruled they hadn&rsquo;t followed procedures mandated by Virginia&rsquo;s constitution.&nbsp;</p>
