data/sources/coverage/politico-greenland-eu-2026-09-07.html:1239:<p>U.S. President Donald Trump has made repeated threats to take over Greenland. In July, he <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BsTdpr-sce4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">said</a>&nbsp;that “Greenland … should be controlled by the United States, not by Denmark” at the outset of a NATO summit in Turkey.</p>
